      *>--- conformance-case
      *> id: 1985-FMT-IX_2_5_2
      *> rules: [1985-FMT-IX.2.5.2]
      *> accept: [85]
      *> source-format: fixed
      *> portable: unverified
      *>---
      *> §1985:IX.2.5.2 (THE ALTERNATE RECORD KEY CLAUSE). An output
      *> test: the program must translate and run at 85 and DISPLAY
      *> exactly the lines its .out holds, the outcome the rule
      *> requires. Placed from the audit's draft, confirmed by
      *> scripts/spec/place_witnesses.py (kb/Work PB4995).
000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ALTKEY.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT IXF ASSIGN TO IXFILE
000700         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
000800         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
000900         RECORD KEY IS IX-KEY
001000         ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS IX-ALT WITH DUPLICATES.
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 FILE SECTION.
001300 FD  IXF.
001400 01  IX-REC.
001500     05 IX-KEY PIC X(3).
001600     05 IX-ALT PIC X(1).
001700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001800 P1.
001900     OPEN OUTPUT IXF.
002000     MOVE "001" TO IX-KEY. MOVE "A" TO IX-ALT.
002100     WRITE IX-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY "W1 ERR".
002200     MOVE "002" TO IX-KEY. MOVE "A" TO IX-ALT.
002300     WRITE IX-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY "W2 ERR".
002400     MOVE "003" TO IX-KEY. MOVE "B" TO IX-ALT.
002500     WRITE IX-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY "W3 ERR".
002600     CLOSE IXF.
002700     OPEN INPUT IXF.
002800     MOVE "A" TO IX-ALT.
002900     START IXF KEY IS EQUAL TO IX-ALT
003000         INVALID KEY DISPLAY "START ERR".
003100     READ IXF NEXT RECORD AT END DISPLAY "EOF".
003200     DISPLAY IX-KEY.
003300     READ IXF NEXT RECORD AT END DISPLAY "EOF".
003400     DISPLAY IX-KEY.
003500     CLOSE IXF.
003600     STOP RUN.
